 ```{rubric} Features
 ```
 
+- Add {func}`~rapids_singlecell.pp.normalize_shifted_clr`, the PFlog shifted centered log-ratio of scanpy's `normalize_shifted_clr` ([scverse/scanpy#4160](https://github.com/scverse/scanpy/pull/4160)) {cite:p}`Booeshaghi2022`, with a fused CUDA kernel for CSR input {pr}`702` {smaller}`S Dicks`
