 - Add weighted nearest neighbor (WNN) analysis for multimodal data with {func}`~rapids_singlecell.pp.wnn`, a GPU port of Seurat's `FindMultiModalNeighbors` that accepts {class}`~anndata.AnnData` and `MuData` {pr}`838` {smaller}`S Dicks`
